    {
      "id": "342:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78156:78158"
    },
    {
      "id": "342:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你转过身，在空地边缘的树木前站着查理。他的衣服上飞溅着泥土，头发里缠着断枝。但他在这里，他活得好好的，他在冲着你笑。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78158:78218"
    },
    {
      "id": "342:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“宝贝，”他说，“没事了。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78218:78234"
    },
    {
      "id": "342:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要张开双臂跑向查理，转到 343。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78234:78253"
    },
    {
      "id": "342:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要迟疑，转到 351。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:78253:78266"
    }
  ]
}
